# HighDensityScatterSeries: 25,000 randomly generated points (ScatterHighDensityData) rendered as a black-to-yellow heat map.
# The data is random per run, so no positions or heat colours can be derived (see report).
When we are talking about the axis with name xAxis
Then this axis title will display text 'Plane of Rotation (in Light Years)'
When we are talking about the axis with name yAxis
Then this axis title will display text 'Plane of Rotation (in Light Years)'
When we are talking about the series with name series
Then this series will have some visible pixels
